===Etymology===
''ig-'' (from ''[[ignorant]]'') + ''[[gnostic]]'' + ''-[[ism]]''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# A form of [[agnosticism]] in which [[theism]] is seen as incoherent because of the [[scientific]] untestability of a God or gods.
# Ignorance of any knowledge of a God or gods due to finding that theism lacks a coherent definition of what god is.

